     <section anchor="introduction" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-1.0">
       <name slugifiedName="name-introduction">Introduction</name>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-1.0-1">This document describes an allocation plan for IPv6 addresses to be
-used in testing IPv6 prototype software.  These addresses are
