-Addressing Architecture <xref target="ARCH" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="ARCH"/>.  They may be assigned to nodes
-manually, with IPv6 Auto Address Allocation <xref target="AUTO" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="AUTO"/>, or with DHCP for
-IPv6 <xref target="DHCPv6" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="DHCPv6"/>.</t>
