-        create its own local addressing hierarchy and to identify
-        subnets.  Assignment of the SLA ID field is the
-        responsibility of each individual organization.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-2.0-12"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-   Interface ID
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-2.0-13"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
